meta {
  name: 28 - Chat - Portfolio (live price)
  type: http
  seq: 38
}

post {
  url: http://localhost:8000/chat
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "user_id": "u_demo",
    "message": "how is my investment portfolio doing right now?",
    "history": []
  }
}

docs {
  Exercises: invest-server -> get_portfolio, which pulls LIVE prices from
  Yahoo Finance (yfinance) and computes real-time P&L.
  Expect tools_used to include "get_portfolio" (may also call get_live_price).
  NOTE: needs outbound internet from the container; if Yahoo is unreachable
  it degrades gracefully (invested value shown, live value may be null).
}
